      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A three-step reaction sequence has been developed to prepare a variety of enantioenriched pyrroloisoquinoline derivatives. The process involves a catalytic asymmetric azomethine ylide 1,3-dipolar cycloaddition followed by an intramolecular AuI-catalyzed alkyne hydroamination and enamine reduction."},
